          %div
            %h3#ReferencesAnyonicBraidingInMomentumSpace Nodal braiding in momentum-space
            %p
              On non-trivial
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/braid+group+statistics"} braiding
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nodal+points"} nodal points
